== Effects ==
* Triggers the {{i|Teleport!}} effect whenever an [[active item]] is used.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r}}: Triggers the {{i|Teleport 2.0}} effect whenever an [[active item]] is used.

== Infinite Synergies ==
* {{i|Bob's Rotten Head}} (works before throwing the head)
* {{i|Shoop da Whoop!}} (works before firing the laser)
* {{i|Guppy's Paw}}
** {{dlc|nr}} It works even without health to convert.
** {{dlc|r}} It works after converting the health.
* {{i|Remote Detonator}} (works even if there are no bombs planted in the room)
* {{i|Notched Axe}} (works before swinging the axe)
* {{i|The Candle}} (works before firing the candle)
* {{i|Portable Slot}} (works after consuming a coin, but still works with 0 coins)
* {{i|How to Jump}} (works before jumping)
* {{i|Red Candle}} (works before firing the candle)
* {{i|The Jar}} (works before putting hearts in the jar)
* {{i|The Boomerang}} (works before throwing the boomerang)
* {{i|Glass Cannon}} (works before shooting)
* {{I|Friendly Ball}} (works before throwing the ball)
* {{i|Ventricle Razor}} (works after creating a portal)
* {{i|Jar of Flies}} (works after releasing the flies)
* {{i|Potato Peeler}}
** {{dlc|nr}} It works even without health to convert.
** {{dlc|r}} Doesn't work without health to convert.
* {{i|Black Hole}} (works before shooting the hole)
* {{i|Mom's Bracelet}} (works immediately without having to pick up a rock)
* {{i|Sharp Key}} (works before firing a key)
* {{i|Urn of Souls}} (works after capping/uncapping the urn)
* {{i|Vade Retro}} (works even if there are no souls to explode on the screen)
* {{i|Bag of Crafting}} (works before picking a pickup)
* {{i|Gello}} (works before firing the familiar)
* {{i|Decap Attack}} (works before firing the familiar)

