* {{dlc|nr}} {{i|A Pony}} (no longer teleports before the charge is expended)
* {{dlc|nr}} {{i|White Pony}} (no longer teleports before the charge is expended)

== Other Interactions ==
* {{i|D10|nr}}: Using D10 while holding this will first teleport Isaac, and then reroll the enemies in the new room.

== Notes ==
* Upon using {{i|The Bible}} while fighting {{E|Mom}} or {{E|Mom's Heart}} / {{E|It Lives!}}, Isaac will get teleported out of the room before the death animation is finished, resulting in the boss room being reset.
* This item can only teleport Isaac to rooms that can be shown on the map. It is not possible to teleport to the {{R|I AM ERROR}} room, {{R|Devil Room}}, {{R|Angel Room}}, {{R|Crawl Space}}, {{R|Black Market}}, {{R|Boss Rush}}, {{dlc+|a}} the room with the access to {{s|???}}{{dlc-}}, or {{E|Mega Satan}}.
* {{dlc+|r}} During {{E|The Beast}} fight, Broken Remote will teleport you randomly on the screen.{{dlc-}}
* {{i|Spin to Win}} does not work at all with Broken Remote.
* {{i|Mine Crafter}} does not work with Broken Remote if there is already a TNT barrel in the room.
* {{dlc+|r}} For some reason, {{i|Mom's Bracelet}} produces a faster teleport with Broken Remote than with any other item.{{dlc-}}

